BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Warriors
DTSTART:20270310T010000Z
DTEND:20270310T023000Z
DTSTAMP:20261118T003847Z
UID:2292363
DESCRIPTION:<p>Come out to play.<br /><br />Twelve years after revolutioni
 zing theater\, Lin-Manuel Miranda returns to Broadway in a collaboration w
 ith Pulitzer Prize finalist Eisa Davis. Together they have created <em>War
 riors</em> &mdash\; a boundary-pushing adrenaline shot of a musical that t
 ells a story of loyalty\, friendship\, a search for peace\, strength\, and
  survival over one tumultuous night in New York. It&rsquo\;s the heart of 
 the city... the soul of a community... and the sound of something being bo
 rn.<br /><br />Based on the Paramount Pictures motion picture directed by 
 Walter Hill and the book by Sol Yurick\, Warriors is directed by Jenny Koo
 ns and co-directed and choreographed by Andy Blankenbuehler.</p>
LOCATION:Lunt-Fontanne Theatre\, 205 West 46th Street\, New York NY 10036
URL:https://www.telecharge.com/Warriors-Tickets
END:VEVENT
